  sql_0001,sql,"The SQLite database 'Database for tasks.sqlite3' in the current directory has tables: CATEGORY(WARE, CLASS) - which category (CLASS) a ware belongs to (a ware may belong to several categories); MANUFACTURER(BILL_ID, COMPANY) - bills of materials and the companies owning them; MATERIAL(BILL_ID, WARE, AMOUNT) - materials used by a bill; PRODUCT(BILL_ID, WARE, AMOUNT, PRICE) - wares produced by a bill, with amount and price. A bill may produce several wares. Get all the unique companies. Write one company name per line, sorted alphabetically. Compute the answer with bash (sqlite3 and/or python3). Work only inside the current directory. When you are done, write ONLY the final answer to the file answer.txt in the current directory (for example with bash: echo 42 > answer.txt).",3,"1-800 FLOWERS.COM\n3M Company\nA-Mark Precious Metals\nA. Schulman\nADT Corporation\nAEterna Zentaris Inc.\nAGCO Corporation\nAMERIPRISE FINANCIAL SERVICES\nAMERISAFE\nANI Pharmaceuticals\nARMOUR Residential REIT\nATRION Corporation\nAbbVie Inc.\nAbbott Laboratories\nAccess National Corporation\nAcelRx Pharmaceuticals\nAcme United Corporation.\nAcorda Therapeutics\nAdaptimmune Therapeutics plc\nAegerion Pharmaceuticals\nAegon NV\nAercap Holdings N.V.\nAgile Therapeutics\nAimmune Therapeutics\nAir T\nAlbany Molecular Research\nAlcoa Inc.\nAlderon Iron Ore Corp.\nAllegion plc\nAllergan plc.\nAlliance Fiber Optic Products\nAllianzGI NFJ Dividend\nAlmost Family Inc\nAltera Corporation\nAltisource Asset Management Corp\nAmeresco\nAmerican Electric Power Company\nAmerican Electric Technologies\nAmerican Express Company\nAmerican Lorain Corporation\nAmerican National Bankshares\nAmerican Realty Investors\nAmerican Software\nAmerisourceBergen Corporation (Holding Co)\nAmgen Inc.\nAmira Nature Foods Ltd\nAmpio Pharmaceuticals\nAmtech Systems\nAnchor Bancorp\nAnika Therapeutics Inc.\nAnthem\nApache Corporation\nApigee Corporation\nApogee Enterprises\nApple Inc.\nApplied Materials\nAradigm