  sql_0024,sql,"The SQLite database 'Database for tasks.sqlite3' in the current directory has tables: CATEGORY(WARE, CLASS) - which category (CLASS) a ware belongs to (a ware may belong to several categories); MANUFACTURER(BILL_ID, COMPANY) - bills of materials and the companies owning them; MATERIAL(BILL_ID, WARE, AMOUNT) - materials used by a bill; PRODUCT(BILL_ID, WARE, AMOUNT, PRICE) - wares produced by a bill, with amount and price. A bill may produce several wares. Show the companies in the alphabetical order that produce a larger number of different wares than they consume (use as materials). Write one company name per line. Compute the answer with bash (sqlite3 and/or python3). Work only inside the current directory. When you are done, write ONLY the final answer to the file answer.txt in the current directory (for example with bash: echo 42 > answer.txt).",4,"3M Company\nADT Corporation\nAGCO Corporation\nAMERISAFE\nAccess National Corporation\nAcelRx Pharmaceuticals\nAegerion Pharmaceuticals\nAlbany Molecular Research\nAllergan plc.\nAmerican Express Company\nAmtech Systems\nAnthem\nApigee Corporation\nApogee Enterprises\nApple Inc.\nApplied Materials\nAtlantic Coast Financial Corporation\nAuris Medical Holding AG\nAutoNation\nAviat Networks\nB&G Foods\nBall Corporation\nBenitec Biopharma Limited\nBio-Techne Corp\nBioCryst Pharmaceuticals\nBuckle\nBuilders FirstSource\nCACI International\nCCA Industries\nCNB Financial Corporation\nCONSOL Energy Inc.\nCUI Global\nCVSL Inc.\nCamtek Ltd.\nCarbonite\nCascade Microtech\nCastlight Health\nChambers Street Properties\nChanticleer Holdings\nCheviot Financial Corp\nChina Commercial Credit\nChina Recycling Energy Corporation\nCity Office REIT\nCivitas Solutions\nCoastway Bancorp\nComstock Holding Companies\nConsolidated Water Co. Ltd.\nConstellation Brands Inc\nCousins Properties Incorporated\nCowen Group\nCredicorp Ltd.\nCredit Suisse AG\nCrown Crafts\nDCT Industrial Trust Inc\nDHI Group\nDXP Enterprises\nDaily Jour