  sql_0026,sql,"The SQLite database 'Database for tasks.sqlite3' in the current directory has tables: CATEGORY(WARE, CLASS) - which category (CLASS) a ware belongs to (a ware may belong to several categories); MANUFACTURER(BILL_ID, COMPANY) - bills of materials and the companies owning them; MATERIAL(BILL_ID, WARE, AMOUNT) - materials used by a bill; PRODUCT(BILL_ID, WARE, AMOUNT, PRICE) - wares produced by a bill, with amount and price. A bill may produce several wares. Get all the unique companies producing at least one ware from each category in the set: Fuel, Food and Mineral. Write one company name per line, sorted alphabetically. Compute the answer with bash (sqlite3 and/or python3). Work only inside the current directory. When you are done, write ONLY the final answer to the file answer.txt in the current directory (for example with bash: echo 42 > answer.txt).",2,"Altera Corporation\nAmtech Systems\nAnthem\nApogee Enterprises\nBenchmark Electronics\nBlack Knight Financial Services\nBuckle\nCNB Financial Corporation\nCUI Global\nCamden Property Trust\nCastle Brands\nCheviot Financial Corp\nConsolidated Water Co. Ltd.\nCredit Suisse AG\nCytRx Corporation\nDover Downs Gaming & Entertainment Inc\nElbit Imaging Ltd.\nElizabeth Arden\nEvolving Systems\nGerman American Bancorp\nGlobe Specialty Metals Inc.\nHasbro\nHexcel Corporation\nHospitality Properites Trust\nImmunoCellular Therapeutics\nIncome Opportunity Realty Investors\nKronos Worldwide Inc\nM/A-COM Technology Solutions Holdings\nMicrosoft Corporation\nNeustar\nNorwegian Cruise Line Holdings Ltd.\nPfenex Inc.\nPilgrim&#39;s Pride Corporation\nPlumas Bancorp\nProgress Software Corporation\nRELM Wireless Corporation\nRXI Pharmaceuticals Corporation\nResMed Inc.\nRoyal Bank Scotland plc (The)\nSFX Entertainment\nSage Therapeutics\nSecond Sight Medical Products\nSimon Property Group\nSpectrum Pharmaceuticals\nThe Andersons\nTower Semiconductor Ltd.\nTransAct Technologies Incorporated\nTriumph Group\nVera Bradle